('22. Security, privacy and abuse controls',['Added Firebase bearer verification, revoked-session boundaries where supplied, ownership checks, private conversation rules, safe DOM subtitle text and guarded native actions.','Added rate limits, signed request/usage state, replay/idempotency protections, ordered conversation sessions, stale-result suppression and explicit resource cleanup.','Added a safe credential-shape scanner for current source, reachable history and build/log text without printing matched secrets or reading private credential stores.','Kept Studio originals device-local and microphone/camera capture opt-in. No arbitrary model shell/code mutation was introduced.'],['netlify/functions/_shared/provider.mjs','netlify/functions/_shared/vanessa-router.mjs','firestore.rules','zorifi-privacy.js','scripts/check-secret-exposure.cjs'],['No app can honestly be guaranteed unhackable or impossible to inspect/copy.','The exposed OpenAI key was confirmed not revoked on16November. A clean scan does not revoke it; promotion remains blocked.','Automatic account/device bans and comprehensive server-side entitlement protection are not universally implemented.']),
